## Sequence — <!-- tên flow 1, trùng heading "Step-by-step Flow — ..." trong design.md -->

<!--
Mỗi participant đứng cho một layer/actor. Dùng alias ngắn + tên file thật trong dấu ngoặc:
  - C: Client
  - H: <Feature>Handler (delivery/http)
  - U: <Verb><Feature>Usecase
  - R: <Feature>Repository
  - DB: Postgres
  - Thêm participant cho external service nếu flow chạm tới (pkg/sms, pkg/mailer, GCS, ...).
Transaction boundary: bọc các message trong `rect rgb(...)` + `Note over R,DB: MỘT transaction`.
Nhánh lỗi: `alt`/`else`/`end`; return lỗi dùng mũi tên `--x`.
-->

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as {{Feature}}Handler<br/>(delivery/http)
    participant U as {{Verb}}{{Feature}}Usecase
    participant R as {{Feature}}Repository
    participant DB as Postgres
    %% participant S as pkg/sms  (thêm nếu flow gọi external service)

    C->>H: POST /v1/{{path}}
    H->>H: DecodeJSONBodyStrict + validate DTO
    H->>U: Execute(ctx, input)
    U->>U: domain validation → sentinel error nếu fail
    U->>R: <Method>(ctx, ...)

    rect rgb(235, 240, 255)
        Note over R,DB: MỘT transaction
        R->>DB: SELECT / INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE ...
        alt success
            R-->>U: entity / id
        else unique violation / lỗi DB
            R--xU: domain sentinel error → rollback
        end
    end

    alt success
        U-->>H: result
        H-->>C: 200 / 201 {...}
    else failure
        U--xH: sentinel error
        H-->>C: 4xx / 5xx {code, message}
    end
```

